<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes<br />
Page Type: SCP Article<br />
Elevator Pitch: A large millipede that is friendly to humans and kills all harmful germs near it.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: A millipede that is about 3 feet long that kills all microscopic life near it. When germs are talked about near it it expresses displeasure and will move to the door to try to get out and clean the germs off of the walls. It also seems to only target germs that are harmful to humans and leaves beneficial germs alone.</p>
<p>Hook: It will be a kind light hearted SCP that is just a germaphobe. It is also of use to The Foundation as a cleaner.</p>

