			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4831352">
									

<p>Sadly this is not gonna work as a main site article in its current state. It feels very much like a series one article, which follows a format the site has long moved from. I highly recommend reading more into the 5000 series of articles, which really highlight the focus on <em>storytelling</em> as opposed to just a strange object.</p>
<p>What you have presented is unfortunately not only basic and not very interesting but something that has already been done before (but with a millipede coating). The hatred for organic life? Yea we got SCP-682 and many others that hate organic life, it kills, kills and kills? That's not very entertaining on its own. You need to rethink this idea, a LOT. Think of a story, maybe the millipede was once a person or something? (very basic idea). Explore different stories you wanna tell and use your SCP as the vessel of that story.</p>

							</div>

