<blockquote>
<p>Why is it a millipede?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Hmmm&#8230; I haven't given that one much consideration. (As I think you can tell.) I think that the thing that inspired me to make it a millipede was a picture I saw of a giant extinct millipede species. Maybe it could be one of those that managed to survive somehow.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Why does it attack things?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Again, not sure. In fact I think I'm going to scrap that part entirely. Maybe it's just a weird millipede germaphobe. I think that I actually like that better. Thanks!</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Why is it a germaphobe?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Ok, this is my favorite part. It's a germaphobe because in this universe a plague was what wiped out the rest of it's species. (Man they could have really used 049.) It was the only one who could fend off the plague using it's anomalous properties.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>This is actually the most interesting aspect at the moment</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I know.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>maybe give it cleaning supplies and have it join the site cleaning crew.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Haha! Actually that might be a good idea&#8230; especially if that's it's only anomalous property. Come to think of it I actually really like that idea.</p>
<p>I'm going to change the SCP Idea to be a millipede that is able to kill all germs that are near it. (Exact distance yet to be determined.) Scrap everything else this is what the idea is now. Thank you for the ideas! I have edited the original post to represent this.</p>

